Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should've flown over the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.29,0:00:26.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It's too late, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess I just have to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.83,0:00:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,They say that beautiful flowers have thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:40.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Occasionally, beautiful things will\Nbare their fangs when you touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.79,0:00:48.08,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, on another note,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,who is this beauty blooming as\Nbeautifully as the most colorful flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:38.00,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Girl as Pretty as a Flower"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:43.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What a magnificent field of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:55.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you the one taking\Ncare of this flower field?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.04,0:03:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no one taking care of this flower field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just here because I like flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just playing with the flowers\Nwhile basking in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:12.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, these flowers are growing here naturally?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:14.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.04,0:03:18.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Traveler, are you a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I might ask a favor of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:30.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to bring this bouquet\Nto the country you are about to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:35.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't mind, but who should I give it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyone. What's important is that\Nsomeone thinks these flowers are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, you'd like me\Nto advertise this flower field?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do it happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll make sure\Nto give these to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:04:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:15.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Girl, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:17.92,Main,,0,0,0,,"Girl"? Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:19.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:23.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have business with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:24.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you a traveler?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:27.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell by looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:29.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that bouquet of flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Show it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You... Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:38.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.83,0:04:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Please return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:46.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the rest. You go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:50.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Sir, this shawl... and these\Nflowers... They might be--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You should go rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please return the bouquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Recently, his younger sister went missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,and he's been like that ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Please forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:18.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a lie, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:26.21,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, sorry, but will you\Nlet us dispose of those flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.21,0:05:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,They are not allowed into this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:32.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Those flowers are poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Poisonous?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But I was fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,They won't do anything to a witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,but there's magic in them that will make\Npeople who can't use magic go insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes people go insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:50.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, people who are mesmerized by the flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,are drawn to them like bees to honey
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,and led to where the flowers bloom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:57.96,Main,,0,0,0,,becoming nutrients for them to feed off of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:06:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why you must dispose of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:05.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this. You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:26.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Naw, you were just imagining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.71,0:06:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Flower field...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:38.33,Main,,0,0,0,,In my favorite book, {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,there is a story about a strange plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Normally, plants release magic\Nfor us after absorbing sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:53.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But, through a sudden mutation,\Nit started sucking magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,became sentient, and started acting violently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:57.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what the story was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:07:00.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:07.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The next day, before\NI left for the next country,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I went to the flower field\NI had visited the day before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.13,0:07:13.21,Main,,0,0,0,,There was something I wanted to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks for yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.29,Main,,0,0,0,,About your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:27.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I finally found her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,...thanks to your bringing\Nher shawl and that bouquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I figured out that she was here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:40.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I finally... finally found her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You've become so pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Trying to keep such\Na wonderful place to yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's show this place\Nto everyone in the country, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, I want to show you off now\Nthat you've become as pretty as a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:08.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I see, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You really are pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:06.00,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Bottled Happiness"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:19.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:22.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you came!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:26.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a real witch! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:36.58,Main,,0,0,0,,So, I'm on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:42.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:43.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a bottle where I'm gathering happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You're gathering happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I turn the moments people and\Nanimals feel happiness into magic
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,and put them into this bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:58.79,Main,,0,0,0,,So you can use magic, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:02.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you changing feelings into magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:04.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.42,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,If you open this here, then my\Nhard work will come to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,These are precious treasures\NI've been gathering for the girl I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm a little moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It reminded me of a book I read in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,A book?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,For the sake of his wife, who was sick\Nand couldn't leave the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:34.21,Main,,0,0,0,,a husband travels around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,recreating beautiful views with magic
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:40.63,Main,,0,0,0,,so he could bring them home\Nand show them to his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet his wife was really happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she was healed and lived a long life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,So, who's this girl you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:11:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a servant named Nino\Nwho works at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,She always looks gloomy,\Nso I want to cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm bottling up happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:10.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Feelings of plants?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:14.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:17.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I tried to see if I could\Nget happiness from them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:19.04,Main,,0,0,0,,but it didn't really work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're lucky the plants didn't use you for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:22.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can see it up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What a peaceful village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:41.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:44.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that the village chief's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It's my house, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't seem that interested, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:54.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Would it be better for me to act surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing! You're rich, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:01.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, right, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,When will you give her that bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:07.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I'll give it to her\Nafter we finish lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Why don't you come eat lunch with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The food Nino makes is really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the invitation,\Nbut I just ate breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:21.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll make sure you get a smaller portion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Are there any foods you don't like or can't eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.25,0:12:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't like mushrooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:27.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it. I'll make sure she doesn't put any in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:29.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Please make sure it's a small portion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:31.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The food'll definitely be really delicious--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:35.42,Main,,0,0,0,,made by Nino!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:38.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.71,0:12:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:13:00.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Could you be from a land in the east?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:03.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you just seemed similar to someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,My dad found her in an eastern land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:14.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Found...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's why you're here...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:23.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The village chief is... very kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is the village chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,He's working in his study...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:33.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Nino! What's for lunch today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,T-Today, the village chief said\Nhe wants... fish grilled with salt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:43.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you make some for\NMiss Witch over there, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Miss Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:46.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.33,Main,,0,0,0,,But please don't give me too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Nino!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a present for you after lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,F-For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:14:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:01.96,Main,,0,0,0,,N-No, that's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The village chief will be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:09.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it! I'll explain to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, this is an order from me:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Take the present, Nino.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.92,0:14:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,If it's an order...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:25.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall I help with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:27.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You can have a seat, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.92,0:14:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? It's unusual for us to have a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you the village chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:42.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I am the traveling witch, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What a polite young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:56.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Please make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry to keep you waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.67,0:15:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a {\i1}small {\i0}portion...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,No... Well, shall we eat...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:46.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food. It was very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:59.83,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, thank you... very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:01.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll put the dishes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:02.38,Main,,0,0,0,,--I'll help, too--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh, don't worry about it, Miss Witch.\N--I'll help, too--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:04.88,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh, don't worry about it, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:23.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You met Nino in a land in the east?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bought her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:26.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Bought...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.29,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,A few years ago, my wife left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,There was a period when we had\Nproblems getting the housework done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I found her in an eastern land when\NI was there for work around that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,She was expensive,\Nbut she could do some housework,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,and most of all, she is sure to\Nbe a beauty when she grows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:47.83,Main,,0,0,0,,so I bought her without any hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.83,0:16:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,As I thought, she's a great servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Does Emil know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:58.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I told him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:03.08,Main,,0,0,0,,but he doesn't care if the\Nother person is a slave or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.29,0:17:15.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nino, where should I put the big plat--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You worthless piece of junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,How long will it take before you\Nlearn to do your job perfectly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:29.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.54,Main,,0,0,0,,--Clean it up!\N--I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That was {\i1}my {\i0}fault just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,--Nino didn't--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.25,0:17:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}--You {\i0}shut up!\N--Nino didn't--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}--You {\i0}shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:38.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:38.92,Main,,0,0,0,,--Yes, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:39.79,Main,,0,0,0,,--You don't need to clean it up.\N--Yes, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.79,0:17:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--You don't need to clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:42.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:15.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Next time, be careful not to drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:18.25,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,For you to see something so disgraceful,\Nand then even fixing the china for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:26.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, you thank her properly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:34.04,Main,,0,0,0,,At times like this, you should say "Thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.33,0:18:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you... very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I could've done magic like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Was my help unwelcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:53.17,Main,,0,0,0,,No. Thanks, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:55.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:58.13,Main,,0,0,0,,But, I could've...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, Nino seems very\Ndepressed right now, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the perfect time\Nto give her present to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Witch, you might be a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Feel free to praise me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:26.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I said earlier that I had\Na present for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:28.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Here, this is your present.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a bottle filled with happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Happiness...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:41.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It's filled with the happiness of\Nvarious people I found in various places.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The happiness of... various people...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You can only see it once, so look carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.67,0:19:51.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Ready, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.79,0:20:01.33,Main,,0,0,0,,These are pieces of happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:34.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The outside world is\Nfilled with all this happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:37.21,Main,,0,0,0,,So don't always look so gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:39.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:43.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Make me... happy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Come back and visit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:05.96,Main,,0,0,0,,When you come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Nino and I will make food that's\Neven more delicious for you! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.13,0:21:13.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll come back and visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What lovely colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:37.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It was then that I remembered the\Nending of the book I read in the past--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The beautiful scenes the husband brought home
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.25,0:21:50.54,Main,,0,0,0,,ended up making his wife, who couldn't\Ngo anywhere, even more depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,And then, his wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:22:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,"Just because you are doing something\Nfor someone else doesn't make it right."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a really preachy story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.21,0:22:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Kindness and beauty can sometimes become cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.29,0:22:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to Nino after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.54,0:22:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I don't {\i1}want {\i0}to know...
